  "We coated 14 porch floor panels with leading enamels and exposed them to a full year of foot traffic, rain, sun, and freeze-thaw. Only 7 earned our recommendation. Latex, oil, and epoxy porch floor paints — ranked and reviewed, plus the haint blue ceiling tradition.";

