          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">June 22, 2026</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:block ml-auto"><SocialProof users="9.4k" /></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-4">In This Guide</h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#paint-types" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. Porch Paint Types: Latex vs Oil vs Epoxy Enamel</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Our 7 Top Picks Reviewed</a>
          <a href="#how-to-paint" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. How to Paint a Porch Floor</a>
          <a href="#prep" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Surface Prep: The Step Everyone Underestimates</a>
